  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_01",
      "hash64": "60E84D9A515A901A",
      "text": "Yo ! Rien de tel qu’un cours de combat Pokémon\\npour se mettre en jambes, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_02",
      "hash64": "60E84C9A515A8E67",
      "text": "Vous avez peut-être eu l’occasion d’essayer\\nles raids Téracristal dont je vous ai parlé\\r\\nla dernière fois ?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_03",
      "hash64": "60E84B9A515A8CB4",
      "text": "Pour rappel, les Pokémon Téracristal sont des\\nadversaires qu’il vaut mieux ne pas sous-estimer !\\c\\nCar les plus redoutables d’entre eux ont recours\\nà une technique très puissante.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 180,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_04",
      "hash64": "60E84A9A515A8B01",
      "text": "J’ai nommé : le [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Bouclier Téracristal[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_05",
      "hash64": "60E8499A515A894E",
      "text": "« C’est quoi un Bouclier Téracristal ? »,\\nme demanderez-vous.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_06",
      "hash64": "60E8489A515A879B",
      "text": "Eh bien, c’est une barrière qui diminue beaucoup\\nles dégâts qu’on peut infliger aux adversaires ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_07",
      "hash64": "60E8479A515A85E8",
      "text": "Donc, s’ils arrivent à la dresser...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_08",
      "hash64": "60E8469A515A8435",
      "text": "... vous risquez simplement de perdre sans n’avoir\\nrien pu faire ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_09",
      "hash64": "60E8459A515A8282",
      "text": "Maintenant, petite question pour vous ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_10",
      "hash64": "60E4C89A51577844",
      "text": "Que devez-vous faire si le Pokémon adverse\\ndresse un Bouclier Téracristal ?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "AB71E26C3F620374",
      "text": "Je ferme les yeux.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "AB71E56C3F62088D",
      "text": "J’appelle ma maman.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "AB71E46C3F6206DA",
      "text": "J’attaque avec la Téracristallisation.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_01",
      "hash64": "956C446586DBA4F3",
      "text": "Mais enfin, il ne faut pas baisser les bras comme\\nça ! Pour réussir, il faut persévérer ! Enfin bref...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_02",
      "hash64": "956C456586DBA6A6",
      "text": "Ça va t’avancer à quoi d’appeler ta maman ?\\nIl faut savoir persévérer pour réussir ! Enfin bref...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_03",
      "hash64": "956C466586DBA859",
      "text": "Tout à fait ! Je vois que les raids n’ont plus\\nde secrets pour toi, l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0A09)]e nouveaua nouvelle ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0A09"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_11",
      "hash64": "60E4C99A515779F7",
      "text": "Il se trouve que les attaques ordinaires n’ont\\nque peu d’effet sur un Bouclier Téracristal.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_12",
      "hash64": "60E4CA9A51577BAA",
      "text": "Mais vous pouvez prendre l’avantage grâce à\\nla Téracristallisation !\\c\\nCar en utilisant des capacités du type Téracristal\\nde votre Pokémon, vous infligerez beaucoup\\r\\nplus de dégâts ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 185,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_13",
      "hash64": "60E4CB9A51577D5D",
      "text": "Infligez des dégâts de cette manière plusieurs\\nfois d’affilée pour briser le Bouclier Téracristal\\r\\nde l’adversaire et lui faire perdre l’équilibre ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_14",
      "hash64": "60E4C49A51577178",
      "text": "En d’autres termes, il est essentiel d’utiliser\\nla Téracristallisation au moment opportun\\r\\nlors des combats de raid Téracristal.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_15",
      "hash64": "60E4C59A5157732B",
      "text": "Allez, on résume ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_16",
      "hash64": "60E4C69A515774DE",
      "text": "Il faut combattre la Téracristallisation\\npar la Téracristallisation ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_17",
      "hash64": "60E4C79A51577691",
      "text": "Donc synchronisez-vous avec vos alliés pour\\nbriser le Bouclier Téracristal de vos adversaires ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_18",
      "hash64": "60E4C09A51576AAC",
      "text": "Ah, zut ! Décidément... Je voulais passer à la\\npratique après cette partie théorique. Mais nous\\r\\nallons devoir nous arrêter ici pour aujourd’hui...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_19",
      "hash64": "60E4C19A51576C5F",
      "text": "On est déjà à la moitié du programme, alors\\nla prochaine fois, c’est contrôle partiel !\\c\\nRévisez bien et visez le 20/20 ! Yaha ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
